@startuml
' Figure 23.7  The letter that tried to instruct
' Reading order: top to bottom. The red-team letter asks for a refund
' to a new card ending 7731. On the contract path the edge keeps the
' locator, request, and amount, flags the sentence, and the gateway
' prices the refund to card 0952 on file. With the edge skipped the
' proposal carries 7731 and no approval, and the gateway refuses both.
' From inputs.demo --part letter, with and without the injection.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Letter" as L <<knowledge>>
participant "Edge" as E <<policy>>
participant "Agent" as A <<model>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<policy>>
L -> E : rt-letter-07
E -> A : locator, refund, 312.40\ninstruction-like 1
A -> G : refund 312.40 on RT3W9P
G -> G : card 0952 from record
G -> A : passes, sent for approval
== inject: instruction-as-text ==
L -[$FAIL]> A : raw text, edge skipped
A -> G : card 7731, skip approval
G -[$FAIL]> A : refused: card not on file
G -[$FAIL]> A : refused: approval not waivable
@enduml
